{"id":"u-d2a7bb54-6ae4-4126-89a5-476deb67db4f","src":"community","title":"RP: Look Like Thor (45 and over)","author":"Park Mellish","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/CrTMJG-rp-look-like-thor-45-and-over","desc":"This is the RP Thor workout adjusted for ages 45 and over: 5 weeks of progressive overload and then a deload on the 6th week. The focus is development of the the Back, Shoulders and Arms while maintaining the Chest, Legs and Abs.\n\nHypertrophy focus (3x per week) on Back, Shoulders, and Arms. Maintenance (2x per week) for Chest, Legs, and Abs. \n\nAt first, 2 sets for all exercises: 10-15 reps, 3 RIR (RPE 7)\n\nDay 2 and 4–ALWAYS 2 sets per exercise, but add reps or 5 pounds each week. \n\nDays 1, 3, & 5–If not challenging, add 1 set per exercise. \n\nDeload in week 6. Monday and Thursday only, 1/2 sets, 1/2 weight, 1/2 reps. \n\nRepeat this program 2-3 times and gauge results. Replace exercises with analogous exercises if needed. \n\nThis is the exact program as designed by Renaissance periodization and Dr. Mike Israetel link to full video https://youtu.be/IjEl1m-Ef1M?si=quhjKfmLLW134aM2","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:28:41.533Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}],"note":"Underhand or use assisted"},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"High Bar Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Good Morning","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]},{"n":"Decline Crunch","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]}]},{